 lo stabilirsi facendo ogni tanto ritorno a casa. Nel frattempo accade qualcosa di molto particolare: Tom e Ian iniziano una relazione l'uno con la madre dell'altro...","tagline":"Anne Fontaine non teme di affrontare i tabù e racconta una storia scandalosa facendone emergere complessità e contraddizioni"},{"language":"en-US","overview":"Lil and Roz are two lifelong friends, having grown up together as neighbors in an idyllic beach town. As adults, their sons have developed a friendship as strong as that which binds their mothers. One summer, all four are confronted by simmering emotions that have been mounting between them, and each find unexpected happiness in relationships that cross the bounds of convention."}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/3DvXDm2tGg9itEMKaYFSV229yjr.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ef3ySEDfWeQWBfXPuc7VLhIsccH.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":111190,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"en-US","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/3DvXDm2tGg9itEMKaYFSV229yjr.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/3DvXDm2tGg9itEMKaYFSV229yjr.jpg","language":"it","width":1400,"height":2100},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/3DvXDm2tGg9itEMKaYFSV229yjr.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/3DvXDm2tGg9itEMKaYFSV229yjr.jpg","language":"it","width":1400,"height":2100},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/zjcClMX75mkXH2jCqxY9XVUmmwu.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/zjcClMX75mkXH2jCqxY9XVUmmwu.jpg","language":"it","width":1400,"height":2100}]},"en":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/hIQqIeG7Ude0QRUFntdLtsAUEBB.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/hIQqIeG7Ude0QRUFntdLtsAU